---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Migrating to the stable API</h1>
    <p>
      The stable package has no compatibility CSS or behavior adapter. Convert
      older markup before upgrading.
    </p>

    <h2>Semantic scope</h2>
    <p>
      Add <code>data-mr</code> to every subtree that should receive semantic/reset
      styling. Replace the transitional <code>.mdl-scope</code> root with
      <code>[data-mr]</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Package imports</h2>
    <p>
      Use <code>markup-refine-lib/css</code> and, when needed,
      <code>markup-refine-lib/behaviors</code>. Compatibility and direct historical
      <code>dist/*</code> package imports are no longer exported.
    </p>

    <h2>Common mappings</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Older API</th><th>Stable API</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>.card</code></td><td><code>.mr-card</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.pill</code></td><td><code>.mr-pill</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.group</code></td><td><code>.mr-cluster</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.responsive-container</code></td><td><code>.mr-container</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.stt-component</code></td><td><code>.mr-shell</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-copyable-snippet</code></td><td><code>data-mr-copyable</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-search-tool</code></td><td><code>data-mr-search</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-stt-action</code></td><td><code>data-mr-shell-action</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>--color-primary</code></td><td><code>--mr-color-primary</code></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
